    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">The Reporting Person was granted restricted stock units (&quot;RSUs&quot;), which represent a contingent right to receive one share of Common Stock for each RSU. The RSUs are subject to a service-based
vesting requirement, which shall be satisfied over a 3-year period commencing on June 1, 2026. 1/12th of the RSUs shall vest on June 20, 2026, and the remainder shall vest in equal
quarterly installments thereafter, provided that the Reporting Person remains in continuous service on each such vesting date. Quarterly vesting dates are March 20, June 20, September 20 and December
